<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Ucapan Birthday</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pacifico&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <main class="content-card">
        <div class="card-ribbon">Special Wishes</div>
        <div class="character">💌🌷</div>
        <h1>Special Wishes</h1>
        <p class="card-text">
          Happy Birthday to my dearest childhood friend. Time flies so fast,
          changing two little kids who loved to play into the amazing and
          mature person you are today.
        </p>
        <p class="card-text">
          Thank you for being the most gorgeous part of my childhood memory,
          and thank you for always being my inspiration. May this maturity
          bring you endless happiness, good health, and endless success.
          Wish you all the best!
        </p>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="message-card">
            <h3>For You</h3>
            <p>May this day feel warm, full of smiles, and filled with unexpected happiness.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="message-card">
            <h3>Best Wishes</h3>
            <p>May you always stay healthy, happy, and become the best version of yourself.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="button-row">
          <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-next="index.html">Back to start</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" data-next="page-foto.html">Continue to the next page</button>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
